======================================================================
Part 1: D_KAraw(s) closed form for s<=h, via substitution u=s-v
======================================================================
Integrand after v = s-u substitution: exp(-u**2/2 - u*z - s/eps + u/eps)
Exponent identity: -v/eps-(s-v)^2/2-(s-v)z |_{v=s-u}  ==  -s/eps-u^2/2-u*(z-1/eps)
residual 0. PASS

=> D_KAraw(s) = e^{-s/eps} * int_0^s e^{-u^2/2-u*w} du,  w:=z-1/eps   (for s<=h)

======================================================================
Part 2: D(s) = e^{-s/eps}*[1 - w*int_0^s e^{-u^2/2-uw}du], via M_y=-w
======================================================================
M_y + w = 0, i.e. M_y = -w exactly -- residual 0. PASS
D(s) [s<=h] = D_KB(s) + M_y*D_KAraw(s)
            = e^{-s/eps} + (-w)*e^{-s/eps}*int_0^s e^{-u^2/2-uw}du
            = e^{-s/eps} * [1 - w*int_0^s e^{-u^2/2-uw}du]      -- as claimed

======================================================================
Part 3: negative lobe, s > h -- closed form and bound
======================================================================
Same exponent identity applies (v=s-u substitution is s,h-independent)
=> D_KAraw(s) [s>h] = e^{-s/eps} * int_{s-h}^{s} e^{-u^2/2-u*w} du
=> D(s) [s>h] = -w * e^{-s/eps} * int_{s-h}^{s} e^{-u^2/2-uw} du  <= 0

Bound: int_{s-h}^{s}(...) <= int_0^inf(...) = R(w) [subinterval of [0,inf)]
|D(s)| <= w*R(w)*e^{-s/eps} = (1-sigma(w))*e^{-s/eps} <= e^{-s/eps}
int_h^inf |D(s)| ds <= int_h^inf e^{-s/eps} ds = eps*e^{-h/eps}
Direct symbolic check: int_h^inf e^{-s/eps} ds = eps*exp(-h/eps) = eps*e^{-h/eps}  -- confirmed
residual 0. PASS

